From d4aa2f3347022a916a9d0ab44de0fcbfbcd2c23a Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: reaper <theunbounddeveloper@outlook.com>
Date: Sun, 2 Aug 2026 10:16:43 -0400
Subject: [PATCH 287/288] reaper v2.0.8: dictionary text refresh - Wireless tab
 renamed Wireless Quality (RWIF_1, all 25 languages), RDEV_02 'Network
 legible' -> 'Network Ledger' corrected in all 25 languages (each had
 translated the typo's readable-meaning), and the RWAC_1..36 string set added
 lockstep (dormant; reserved for the shelved Wi-Fi Accelerator page - see
 branch accel-experiment). No code changes; the accelerator page/CGI/menu and
 the v2.0.9 rwatch probes are NOT in this line (v2.0.9/v2.1.0 field reboot
 loop - feature shelved)

Co-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
